 "script": "Revolut services went down Tuesday after one power failure at Google Cloud. Google said a power event hit its London region around seven a.m. UK time. ITV News said card payments, transfers and cash withdrawals were hit. Revolut said customers' money and data are safe. Lloyds, HSBC and Halifax customers also reported problems. Here's the weak spot. Google's London region has three zones. Only one failed. Even a court video system went down. Google says services are now recovering. How would you pay if your bank app went dark? Tell us below.",
